{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Depths Of My Guilt</strong> is a short underwater/submarine horror game where the monster can hear your mic!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a scientist named Dr. Mared. You are tasked with surveying a small portion of a newly discovered ocean hidden beneath the Earth's crust. You will be piloting a rusty, small, and cramped submarine through which you will conduct your research.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you get down there, you soon realize that you're not the only intelligent creature in the depths. Will you uncover <span class=\"bb_strike\">your\u00a0</span>the ocean's secrets before they uncover you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Piloting the Submarine:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of your rusty research vessel using the navigation console and map. Adjust your speed with the lever and steer using the wheel. Every movement counts \u2014 and every sound could be your last.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your mission:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've been sent into a newly discovered ocean beneath the Earth's crust. Your task: gather a <strong>photo and audio sample\u00a0</strong>from each of the<strong>\u00a0marked zones</strong>. Use the onboard <strong>camera</strong> and <strong>mic console</strong> to complete your objectives. Find out what happened to those sent before you \u2014 but tread carefully..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Surviving:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re not alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something else lurks in the dark \u2014 and it can <strong>hear you</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is <strong>blind</strong>, but hyper-aware of sound.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When it draws near, <strong>shut off all power</strong> and <strong>stay completely silent</strong> \u2014 it can even hear your mic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remain quiet... and it will pass.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fuel:<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823670/extras/8a094ba54cfcdecbd7581dfc9d9fc398.poster.avif?t=1772432846\" width=610 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823670/extras/8a094ba54cfcdecbd7581dfc9d9fc398.webm?t=1772432846\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823670/extras/8a094ba54cfcdecbd7581dfc9d9fc398.mp4?t=1772432846\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your vessel needs fuel. Thankfully, Coal ore can be found in the environment and can be used as fuel. You\u2019ll have to leave the vessel to collect them, though. They are found in caves.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Caves:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823670/extras/3b7a5c9c0ecd7ee140267787e2b9d5cd.poster.avif?t=1772432846\" width=610 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823670/extras/3b7a5c9c0ecd7ee140267787e2b9d5cd.webm?t=1772432846\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823670/extras/3b7a5c9c0ecd7ee140267787e2b9d5cd.mp4?t=1772432846\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These waters are home to intricate system of underwater caves and tunnels. The previous &quot;explorers&quot; would rest in the air pockets found in here, you will be able to find use full stuff in there.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Biomes:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823670/extras/3869a29f34226dacb4441ff1404a5b38.poster.avif?t=1772432846\" width=610 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823670/extras/3869a29f34226dacb4441ff1404a5b38.webm?t=1772432846\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823670/extras/3869a29f34226dacb4441ff1404a5b38.mp4?t=1772432846\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore <strong>three deadly deep-sea biomes</strong> \u2014 <strong>The Volcanic Void</strong>, <strong>Deadwater Abyss</strong>, and <strong>The Icebound Chasm</strong> \u2014 each filled with unique dangers and secrets.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3823670?t=1772432846","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3823670?t=1772432846","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823670/0268f9e7615b37d2da583920a881166af42f739b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772432846","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823670/0268f9e7615b37d2da583920a881166af42f739b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772432846","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Lore references murder"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Depths Of My Guilt</strong> is a short underwater/submarine horror game where the monster can hear your mic!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a scientist named Dr. Mared. You are task